```json
Structural pattern (replace UPPERCASE placeholders with real ABI function names):
  [["<BALANCE_OR_RESERVE_SKEW_FROM_ABI>", ["0x3635c9adc5dea00000"], "0x0", "attacker_address"],
   ["<SHARE_PRICE_READER_OR_REDEEM_FROM_ABI>", [], "0x0", "attacker_address"],
